<title>USA: Funscape acquires Australian concession.</title>
<headline>Funscape acquires Australian concession.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Funscape Corp said Friday it has acquired an oil, gas and mineral lease comprised of 12,904,618 gross acres, situated in the Georgina Subbasin of Australia's Eromanga Basin under concession ATP 615.</p>
<p>Funscape said it acquired an 80 percent net revenue interest lease in exchange for $1 million in restricted common stock. A spokesman said this consisted of 300,000 shares.</p>
<p>The compamu said the lease features oil saturated limestone outcropping from two formations on an 8 mile long anticline. Analogous fields in the same age formation have 1,000 foot pay sections. There is a contract pipeline that is being built across the 450 mile expanse of the property.</p>
</text>
